    "created_at": "2026-09-04T14:30:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-04T14:30:11Z",
    "body": "> Is this a duplicate of [#11755](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11755)?\n\nI would say no, in my example since there is no call to _HostLoadImportedModule_ the error is ignored.\nFrom what I see Gecko is unaffected by this because it doesn't implement _state.[[ErrorToRethrow]]_, and instead will set module script's error to rethrow to the value _LoadRequestedModules_'s promise was rejected with. ",
